{%- comment -%}
  LUMORA PDP SAMPLE REVIEWS  ·  lu-pdp-reviews.liquid  (mockup section 11)
  Paste into: Long Light product template > Add section > Custom Liquid (padding 0), after the FAQ.
  Use when no reviews app is installed. Labelled sample content in four places (eyebrow, the note beside
  the H2, a chip on each review, the disclosure). The skin and tone chips filter the four sample reviews.
  "Write a review" and "Show more reviews" are left out on purpose: there is nothing behind them in a trial.
  With Judge.me installed, use its section instead and keep the sample labels.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section id="reviews" class="lu-sec lu-s-linen lu-pdp-reviews" aria-labelledby="reviews-title">
  <div class="container-fluid">
    <header class="lu-head lu-head--row">
      <div class="lu-head__text">
        <p class="lu-eyebrow">Sample reviews</p>
        <h2 id="reviews-title" class="lu-h2">Notes from week <em>four.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lu-pdp-sample-note"><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-info"/></svg>Sample content written for this concept store to show the layout. Not real customers.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="lu-pdp-reviews__grid">
      <aside class="lu-pdp-summary">
        <p class="lu-pdp-summary__avg lu-tnum">4.7</p>
        <span class="lu-stars lu-stars--lg" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lu-stars__fill" style="--r: 94%"><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span>
        <p class="lu-pdp-summary__n">Based on 52 sample reviews</p>
        <ul class="lu-pdp-dist" aria-label="Rating distribution">
          <li><span>5</span><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><i><b style="--v: 77%"></b></i><em class="lu-tnum">40</em></li>
          <li><span>4</span><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><i><b style="--v: 15%"></b></i><em class="lu-tnum">8</em></li>
          <li><span>3</span><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><i><b style="--v: 6%"></b></i><em class="lu-tnum">3</em></li>
          <li><span>2</span><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><i><b style="--v: 2%"></b></i><em class="lu-tnum">1</em></li>
          <li><span>1</span><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><i><b style="--v: 0%"></b></i><em class="lu-tnum">0</em></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="lu-pdp-summary__label">What people mention</p>
        <ul class="lu-pdp-mentions">
          <li>Sinks in fast <span class="lu-tnum">31</span></li>
          <li>No orange cast <span class="lu-tnum">24</span></li>
          <li>Layers under SPF <span class="lu-tnum">22</span></li>
          <li>Satin finish <span class="lu-tnum">19</span></li>
          <li>Warmth at first <span class="lu-tnum">6</span></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
      <div class="lu-pdp-revlist">
        <div class="lu-pdp-filters" aria-label="Filter reviews">
          <button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter is-on" data-f="All skin">All skin</button><button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter" data-f="Dry">Dry</button><button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter" data-f="Oily">Oily</button><button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter" data-f="Combination">Combination</button><button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter" data-f="Sensitive">Sensitive</button><button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter lu-pdp-filter--gap" data-f="Light">Light</button><button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter" data-f="Medium">Medium</button><button type="button" class="lu-pdp-filter" data-f="Deep">Deep</button>
        </div>
        <article class="lu-pdp-review">
          <header><span class="lu-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5"><span class="lu-stars__fill" style="--r: 100%"><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><time>6 weeks of use</time></header>
          <h3>No gray cast, finally.</h3>
          <p>Every vitamin C I’ve tried left me a little ashy by lunch. This sinks in clear, and by week three my cheeks looked warmer in photos. Three drops, both ends of the day.</p>
          <footer><b>Nia</b><span>Deep skin · combination</span><span class="lu-tag-sample">Sample</span></footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lu-pdp-review">
          <header><span class="lu-stars" aria-label="4 out of 5"><span class="lu-stars__fill" style="--r: 80%"><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><time>5 weeks of use</time></header>
          <h3>Lovely, but give it a minute.</h3>
          <p>Slightly tacky for about thirty seconds, then gone. Under SPF it sits flat. Four stars only because I’d like a pump: the dropper is slower when I’m rushing.</p>
          <footer><b>Sophie</b><span>Light skin · dry</span><span class="lu-tag-sample">Sample</span></footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lu-pdp-review">
          <header><span class="lu-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5"><span class="lu-stars__fill" style="--r: 100%"><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><time>8 weeks of use</time></header>
          <h3>My first step before makeup.</h3>
          <p>Water-light, no smell at all, and foundation goes on smoother over it. The color in the bottle made me nervous. It doesn’t tint, not even on a white towel.</p>
          <footer><b>Marcus</b><span>Medium skin · oily</span><span class="lu-tag-sample">Sample</span></footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lu-pdp-review">
          <header><span class="lu-stars" aria-label="3 out of 5"><span class="lu-stars__fill" style="--r: 60%"><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg><svg><use href="#lu-i-star"/></svg></span><time>7 weeks of use</time></header>
          <h3>Slow, but it got there.</h3>
          <p>I didn’t see much until week three, and I felt some warmth the first few evenings, so I went every other night. By week five my tone looks more even.</p>
          <footer><b>Hana</b><span>Light skin · sensitive</span><span class="lu-tag-sample">Sample</span></footer>
        </article>
        <div class="lu-pdp-revlist__more">
          <p class="lu-disclosure">Sample reviews for this concept store, not from customers. In the live store, every review comes from the review app, and any from a free sample is tagged “Received product free”.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.lu-pdp-sample-note{display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; max-width: 380px; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: var(--lu-radius); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(var(--color-border)); font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-sample-note .lu-ico{width: 20px; height: 20px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));}
.lu-pdp-reviews__grid{display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(0, 8fr); gap: 24px 56px; align-items: start;}
.lu-pdp-summary{padding: 30px 30px 32px; border-radius: var(--lu-radius); background: var(--lu-travertine);}
.lu-pdp-summary__avg{font: 300 88px/.9 var(--lu-display); letter-spacing: -.04em;}
.lu-pdp-summary .lu-stars--lg{margin-top: 14px;}
.lu-pdp-summary__n{margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-dist{display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 22px;}
.lu-pdp-dist li{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px 13px 1fr 26px; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px;}
.lu-pdp-dist .lu-ico{width: 13px; height: 13px; fill: var(--lu-dusk); stroke: none;}
.lu-pdp-dist i{position: relative; height: 8px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; background: var(--lu-sand);}
.lu-pdp-dist i b{position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: var(--v); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; background: var(--lu-dusk);}
.lu-pdp-dist em{font-style: normal; text-align: right; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-summary__label{margin-top: 26px; font: 600 11px/16px var(--lu-body); letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(var(--color-price-sale));}
.lu-pdp-mentions{display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px;}
.lu-pdp-mentions li{display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: var(--lu-pill); background: var(--lu-linen); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;}
.lu-pdp-mentions span{font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-summary__btn{width: 100%; height: 48px; margin-top: 24px;}
.lu-pdp-revlist{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: 40px; align-content: start;}
.lu-pdp-filters{grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));}
.lu-pdp-filter{display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 36px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: var(--lu-pill); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--lu-hairline-strong); font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500;}
.lu-pdp-filter.is-on{background: var(--lu-dusk); color: var(--lu-linen); box-shadow: none;}
.lu-pdp-filter--gap{margin-left: 14px;}
.lu-pdp-review{padding: 26px 0 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));}
.lu-pdp-review header{display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;}
.lu-pdp-review time{font-size: 12.5px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-review h3{margin-top: 14px; font: 400 21px/1.25 var(--lu-display); letter-spacing: -.01em;}
.lu-pdp-review p{margin-top: 8px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-review footer{display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 10px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;}
.lu-pdp-review footer b{font-weight: 600;}
.lu-pdp-review footer span:not(.lu-tag-sample){color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-revlist__more{grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; padding-top: 28px;}
.lu-pdp-revlist__more .m-button{flex: none; height: 48px;}
.lu-pdp-revlist__more .lu-disclosure{margin-top: 0; max-width: 64ch;}
@media (max-width: 767px){
.lu-pdp-sample-note{margin-top: 18px; max-width: none;}
.lu-pdp-reviews__grid{grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px;}
.lu-pdp-summary{display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; column-gap: 18px; padding: 22px 20px 22px;}
.lu-pdp-summary__avg{grid-row: 1 / span 2; font-size: 64px;}
.lu-pdp-summary .lu-stars--lg{margin-top: 6px;}
.lu-pdp-summary__n{margin-top: 4px;}
.lu-pdp-dist, .lu-pdp-summary__label, .lu-pdp-mentions, .lu-pdp-summary__btn{grid-column: 1 / -1;}
.lu-pdp-revlist{grid-template-columns: 1fr;}
.lu-pdp-filters{flex-wrap: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; margin-inline: calc(-1 * 20px); padding-inline: 20px; scrollbar-width: none;}
.lu-pdp-filters::-webkit-scrollbar{display: none;}
.lu-pdp-filter{flex: none;}
.lu-pdp-review{padding: 20px 0 18px;}
.lu-pdp-review h3{font-size: 19px;}
.lu-pdp-review p{font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;}
.lu-pdp-revlist__more{flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding-top: 22px;}
}
.lu-pdp-dist,.lu-pdp-mentions{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.lu-pdp-filter{border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;color:inherit;font-family:var(--lu-body)}
.lu-pdp-filter.is-on{background:var(--lu-dusk);color:var(--lu-linen)}
.lu-pdp-review header{display:flex}
.lu-pdp-review h3{margin:14px 0 0}
</style>
<script>
(function(){
  var root=document.querySelector(".lu-pdp-reviews");if(!root)return;
  var reviews=[].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll(".lu-pdp-review"));
  root.querySelectorAll(".lu-pdp-filter").forEach(function(b){b.setAttribute("aria-pressed",b.classList.contains("is-on"));b.addEventListener("click",function(){
    root.querySelectorAll(".lu-pdp-filter").forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove("is-on");x.setAttribute("aria-pressed","false")});
    b.classList.add("is-on");b.setAttribute("aria-pressed","true");var f=(b.getAttribute("data-f")||"").toLowerCase();
    reviews.forEach(function(r){var who=(r.querySelector("footer")||r).textContent.toLowerCase();r.hidden=!(f==="all skin"||who.indexOf(f)>-1)})})});
})();
</script>
